cs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effectively manage settlers to grow your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip settlers with armor and weapons to turn them into soldiers to strengthen the colony\u2019s defense, or provide them with tools to support efficient work. Additionally, reform barbarians through re-education to accept them as new settlers who follow you, or confine them to gain divine power. As time passes and your followers increase, address food shortages, crime, and social issues, guiding the settlement in the direction you desire.</p>",
